direction: down
question: Question embedding
seeds: Seed entities
hop1: Hop 1 entities
hop2: Hop 2 entities
chunks: Source chunks
llm: LLM answer
question -> seeds: vector top-5
seeds -> hop1: edges valid_to is null
hop1 -> hop2: edges
hop1 -> chunks: chunk_id
hop2 -> chunks: chunk_id
chunks -> llm: 20 chunks + path
